  "headline": "FDA's records show the product is not on the shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the labeler is Strides Pharma Science Limited with a registered plant last inspected VAI on 2026-05-20",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include polyethylene glycol 3350 and electrolytes with orange flavor as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Strides Pharma Science Limited as the labeler and names a registered plant (FEI 3004554612) in India.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended on 2026-05-20 and was classified VAI, with the classification known on 2026-08-14.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 15 units with 1.7 used per day, giving 8.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 271 units with 9.8 used per day, giving 27.7 days on hand and can spare 9 units while keeping at least two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 9 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside, which would raise Lakeside to about 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternative transfer of 9 units from Corvale East (24.9 days on hand) would also achieve 14 days at Lakeside.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
